abstract: >-
  EndsAndBends is an Ifremer software tool written in Java and
  developed in the context of SeaDataNet. It is a marine navigation
  data quality control and track reduction tool that helps data centres
  prepare and check navigation records while retaining a representative
  description of ship trajectories.

  The software can:

  - Read and analyse navigation files in different formats (native NVI, NetCDF, CSV, NMEA, UKOOA).
  - Detect and correct errors in navigation tracks.
  - Reduce the number of navigation points while preserving the required positional accuracy.
  - Export corrected and simplified data in different formats (ASCII, GML, WKT, Shapefile).

  EndsAndBends contributes to data quality control, interoperability
  and FAIRification of marine navigation data within the SeaDataNet
  infrastructure.
